-- title:
--   Pointwise vanishing extends to the closed span
-- statement:
--   Let $\varphi_n$ be continuous linear functionals with $\|\varphi_n\|\le1$ on a real normed space, and suppose $\varphi_n(x)\to0$ for every $x$ in a set $s$. Then
--   $$
--   \varphi_n(x)\to0\qquad\text{for every }x\in\overline{\mathrm{span}}\,s .
--   $$
--
--   Uniformly bounded functionals that vanish asymptotically on generators vanish on their closed span.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/lean/OAI/Analysis/Nonexpansive/FunctionalVanishing.lean#L20-L55

